anscripts/2019/02/14/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"WCN 2019 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2019-04-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"…the high end of our outlook for the quarter and was our highest reported price in over 10 years, up 90 basis points year over year, reflecting the impact of the additional price increases we implemented in mid-2018 in response to accelerating cost pressures and lower recycle commodity values.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/waste-connections-wcn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"WCN 2019 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2019-04-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"Looking at year-over-year results in the first quarter by line of business on a same-store basis, commercial collection revenue increased approximately 5.5% mostly due to price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/waste-connections-wcn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"WCN 2019 Q2","e":"wcn","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"Our pricing strength continues to reflect the rollover benefit of the additional price increases we implemented last year in response to accelerating cost pressures and lower recycled commodity value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/waste-connections-wcn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"WCN 2019 Q2","e":"wcn","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"And so really if you saw last year, many privates were doing double-digit price increases in order to overcome that that same pressure has reemerged this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/waste-connections-wcn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"WCN 2019 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"…exceeded our outlook for 