-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Whitney","x":"Commercial collection revenue increased approximately 5.4%, mostly due to price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/07/waste-connections-wcn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"WCN 2020 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing F. Jackman","x":"So, with regards to carbon taxes that we may incur, those are pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2020 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing F. Jackman","x":"But -- so there's a lot of different things that we're doing, both in the tax that's being imposed upon us, that's being passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing F. Jackman","x":"Look, it's not unusual for -- if a location may believe they're going to price or deliver 4% price to put 4.4% price or so on the street and expect some sort of rollbacks on the implementation for a piece of that price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing F. Jackman","x":"I mean, look no further than a P&G or other consumer product companies that have already telegraphed an 8% or 10% price increase in their business this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2021-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Walter Spracklin","x":"And I find it -- so when I look at your outlook and your decision not to increase guidance here, I know certainly, you only said it a couple of months ago, but given how encouraging it looks and your language around potentially doing that next quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q2","e":"wcn","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing F. Jackman","x":"Looking ahead, we are positioned for higher sequential pricing growth during the second half of the year as a result of incremental price increases we have already put in place to offset certain cost pressures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q2","e":"wcn","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Whitney","x":"As noted earlier, we've already implemented incremental price increases to address these higher costs, resulting in full year 2021 price of approximately 5%, up from 4% in our original outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q2","e":"wcn","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Worthing F. Jackman","x":"…of 110 basis points and adjusted free cash flow of over $585 million, up 18.5% year-over-year, and given expected continuing momentum and margin expansion from these trends position us to raise our full year outlook for revenue, adjusted EBITDA, adjusted EBITDA margin and adjusted free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q2","e":"wcn","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Worthing F. Jackman","x":"…driving elevated acquisition dialogue, and as communicated throughout the year, expect closings related to most of this activity to be more weighted to the second half of the year, which will provide further upside to our increased outlook for the year and strong rollover growth into 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"Price plus volume growth of 7.3% reflects our proactive approach to managing through the current environment by implementing additional price increases to address wage and other cost pressures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"Looking ahead, we are positioned for another sequential increase of pricing growth in Q4 to about 5.5% as the full impact of incremental price increases is realized.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Murray","x":"Just wondering if maybe improved pricing -- you start looking at maybe more aggressively restructuring contracts as we go forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2021 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Worthing Jackman","x":"We've also increased our outlook for the second time this year and are on track for adjusted free cash flow of approximately $1.025 billion in spite of proactively accelerating truck and equipment purchases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/waste-connections-inc-wcn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2025-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ronald Mittelstaedt","x":"We look forward to having better visibility on the tone of the economy, including any government shutdown or tariff-related implications when we provide our formal outlook in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2025-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ronald Mittelstaedt","x":"As far as tariffs, we are hearing from manufacturers that there's probably somewhere in the neighborhood of a 3 up to -- $3,000 up to about a $7,500 per truck impact because it affects different components of both the chassis and the bodies separately.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2025-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Whitney","x":"So then when we think longer term, we think about really the life cycle of the customer and be able to hold on to customers by putting in smart price increases and minimizing the amount of customer loss and of course, rollbacks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q3","e":"wcn","d":"2025-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Whitney","x":"And then the real question becomes what are cost pressures doing and how much price do we need in our unrestricted markets and then how effective are those price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ronald Mittelstaedt","x":"Looking next to AI and our multiyear rollout, which began in 2025, these investments are aimed at enhancing efficiency and boosting productivity by further digitizing and automating our operations and improving forecasting through data analytics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Unknown Analyst","x":"And I think we love hearing about all the tech and AI investments you're making to improve the efficiency in your business, any exciting initiatives you want to call out specifically that's due for implementation this year that we can look forward to?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ronald Mittelstaedt","x":"Remember, we don't always -- we don't focus on the ultimate amount of the dollar amount or percentage of the price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Whitney","x":"And so I'd say that hasn't moved materially, although we look forward to seeing certainly the churn element of that continue to decline as we use better tools, and we've talked about the visibility we have there with our price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ronald Mittelstaedt","x":"As expected, these ongoing improvements have driven cost savings, productivity gains and improved customer service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2025 Q4","e":"wcn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ronald Mittelstaedt","x":"As we have indicated previously, to address these regulatory challenges, we have sought out and we welcome the involvement of the US EPA and constructive efforts to streamline processes, remove regulatory impediments and enable a more effective and efficient response.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/waste-connections-wcn-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2026 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ronald J. Mittelstaedt","x":"…both from external factors driving higher fuel and other commodities and also as a result of our investments in human capital and AI, which have broad implications for our operations, along with continued M&A. In Q1, we saw improving dynamics across our business starting with…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/waste-connections-wcn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2026 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ronald J. Mittelstaedt","x":"Shifting to the subject of technology, our continued investment and focus on AI and our overall digital platform are showing promising results within pricing effectiveness, customer engagement, and asset optimization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/waste-connections-wcn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2026 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Whitney","x":"With over 75% of our price increases already in place or contractually provided for, we have high visibility for full-year 2026 core pricing at the high end of the range we provided, or about 5.5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/waste-connections-wcn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2026 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Whitney","x":"Most of our price increases are in place or known.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/waste-connections-wcn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WCN 2026 Q1","e":"wcn","d":"2026-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ronald J. Mittelstaedt","x":"As noted previously, we have sought out the increased involvement and ov